003b1;</italic>                              </sub><sup>a</sup></td><td align="center">0.35 (0.01)</td><td align="center">0.67 (0.01)</td><td align="center">0.98 (0.02)</td><td align="center">1.29 (0.03)</td></tr><tr><td align="center"><italic>Rapper</italic><bold>tk </bold>Backward<sup><italic>d</italic></sup></td><td align="center">MC<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center">0.42 (0.01)</td><td align="center">0.71 (0.01)</td><td align="center">1.00 (0.02)</td><td align="center">1.30 (0.03)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center"><italic>C</italic><sub>                                 <italic>&#x003b1; </italic>                              </sub><sup>a</sup></td><td align="center">0.35 (0.01)</td><td align="center">0.67 (0.01)</td><td align="center">0.98 (0.02)</td><td align="center">1.29 (0.03)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Values in parentheses indicate standard deviations.</p><p><sup>a</sup>Ensemble average <italic>C</italic><sub><italic>&#x003b1; </italic></sub>RMSD [&#x000c5;] over all successfully modelled proteins.</p><p><sup>b</sup>Ensemble average main chain RMSD [&#x000c5;] over all successfully modelled proteins.</p><p><sup>c</sup>No models could be generated for targets 4ENL, 8ABP, 8TLN under 0.5&#x000c5; <italic>C</italic><sub><italic>&#x003b1; </italic></sub>restraint by RAPPER and <italic>Rapper</italic><bold>tk </bold>forward building.</p><p><sup>d </sup>No models could be generated for targets 3PTE, 4ENL, 5CPA, 8ABP under 0.5&#x000c5; restraint by <italic>Rapper</italic><bold>tk </bold>backward building</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T4"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Comparison of accuracy of all atom modelling</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="center" colspan="4">RAPPER</td><td align="center" colspan="4"><italic>Rapper</italic><bold>tk</bold></td><td align="center" colspan="4"><italic>Rapper</italic><bold>tk </bold>Guided</td></tr><tr><td align="cente